what gradio input components do i need for my four tabs: csv upload, chat message, rag question, and three numbers for savings calculator

AI:
For the CSV analysis tab you need gr.File with file_types set to .csv. For the chat tab you need gr.File for the optional CSV context, gr.Chatbot to display the conversation history, and gr.Textbox for the user to type their message. For the RAG tips tab you need gr.Textbox for the question. For the savings calculator tab you need three gr.Number components for income, expenses, and goal.

Me:
why does gr.Chatbot display messages differently from gr.Textbox, which one should i use for the chat tab

AI:
gr.Chatbot displays conversation history as a two-column dialogue with user messages on the right and bot messages on the left — like WhatsApp. This is much more natural for a chat interface than a plain Textbox that shows everything as flat text.

For the chat tab you need gr.Chatbot because it automatically maintains and displays the full conversation history in the right format. If you used gr.Textbox for chat it would only show the last message and the conversation would disappear every time.

